    "detailed_description": "<strong>WarZone</strong><br>An old school style game where you taking a role of a tough soldier that has been sent to infiltrate an enemy base and destroy it.<br><br><i>Type of game</i><br>Top Down 3d shooter game with a linear action moving upwards <br><br><i>game characteristics</i><br><br>Change Player <br>Choose level of difficulty<br>Fight enemies , drones , tanks , human controlled turrets and robots<br>Use grenades , tanks , updated weapon <br>Pick up heath aid , ammo , grenades , shield<br>Do what ever it takes to complete your mission<br>Reach the highest score possible and get the first place on the score board <br><br><br>You can play this game on any device with windows installed and have a lot of fun .<br>Just make sure you have the requirements to run the game , which is not very high for a low end system.<br>This game is inspired from the old school top down shooters that were played back in the 90's.",
